Forge archetype: Martial Artist. Bias toward mobility, balance, coordination, rotation, core control, relative strength, movement precision, and moderate conditioning; avoid unnecessary hypertrophy bias.
In the catalog this means dynamic hip and leg mobility (leg swings, hip circles, groin and adductor work), rotational and anti-rotation core, single-leg balance and kicking-pattern strength, explosive but controlled plyometrics, and bodyweight push strength.
